LIBRARY     MUSCROLL
DESCRIPTION 'MicroScroll Custom Control, Kraig Brockschmidt'
EXETYPE     WINDOWS
CODE        PRELOAD MOVEABLE DISCARDABLE
DATA        PRELOAD MOVEABLE SINGLE

HEAPSIZE    4096

EXPORTS     WEP                                             @1 RESIDENTNAME

            ?HCtlInfo@@ZCIXZ                                @2
            ?FShowCtlStyleDlg@@ZCHIIP7CKPED@ZP7CII0I@Z@Z    @3
            ?WTranslateCtlFlags@@ZCGKPEDG@Z                 @4
            ?MicroScrollWndProc@@ZCJIIIJ@Z                  @5   
            ?FCtlStyleDlgProc@@ZCHIGGJ@Z                    @6

 ?MSCrColorGet@@ZCKIG@Z         @7
 ?MSCrColorSet@@ZCKIGK@Z        @8
 ?MSDwRangeGet@@ZCKI@Z          @9
 ?MSDwRangeSet@@ZCKIGG@Z        @10
 ?MSFInvertRangeGet@@ZCHI@Z     @11
 ?MSFInvertRangeSet@@ZCHIH@Z    @12
 ?MSFNoPegScrollGet@@ZCHI@Z     @13
 ?MSFNoPegScrollSet@@ZCHIH@Z    @14
 ?MSHwndAssociateGet@@ZCII@Z    @15
 ?MSHwndAssociateSet@@ZCIII@Z   @16
 ?MSWCurrentPosGet@@ZCGI@Z      @17
 ?MSWCurrentPosSet@@ZCGIG@Z     @18

 ?FRegisterControl@@ZCHI@Z      @19

